  "id": "spaghetti-with-garlic-and-basil",
  "name": "Spaghetti with Garlic and Basil",
  "subtitle": "A simple, buttery pasta with fresh basil",
  "description": "Spaghetti tossed with garlic, olive oil, melted butter, basil, and Parmesan for an easy main dish.",
